--- !u!114 &243149743
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 243149742}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 84246a412e120284ebb2f40012066458, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  charName: Cafe Worker
  firstLines:
  - These kids are always tryna bother me this early in the morning.
  - Like omg leave me alone pls. I wanna wake up properly.
  secondLines:
  - This is my only free time.
  - Shoo.
  thirdLines:
  - Oh my gosh why are they ordering so much.
  - I don't even know what "side of oily men" is supposed to mean.
  - I don't get paid enough for this.
  fourthLines:
  - Finally.
  - Break.
  fifthLines:
  - Why are they here this late.
  - Please just let me go home, I'm not even a real character in this game.
  - I'm going to go insane. Free me. I'm not even a chud I don't desere this.
  - Free me..................please............I beg.
  sixthLines:
  - Pro tip, never get a job.
  - It does things to you, like entrapping you in a game called Lives of the DT Chuds
    and then you never get your life back.
  - Don't do it.
  - Just don't.
  idleImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f0327d56db711e84c84a944c1769dbb1, type: 3}
  talkingImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e9662f04b3153e449ad0c1890d60daef, type: 3}
  firstInteraction: 1
  charPositions:
  - {fileID: 1576331993}
  - {fileID: 467234291}
  - {fileID: 1525080591}
  - {fileID: 1713078390}
  - {fileID: 551035813}
  - {fileID: 1320700194}
  charPositionIndex: 0
