--- !u!114 &1159988670
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1159988663}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 84246a412e120284ebb2f40012066458, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  charName: Christian
  firstLines:
  - 'Ayo friend, sorry I didn''t bring my maple syrup today, eh, my meese ate in
    me backyard, eh. '
  - "Tomorrow I'll bring my bag and maple leaf eh. Niagara falls, niagara falls\u2026"
  secondLines:
  - Oh brodi. I don't even know what I'm doing right now to be so honest.
  - All I really got going for me right now is that I'm Canadian I guess *shrugs*
  - "Niagara falls, Niagara falls\u2026"
  thirdLines:
  - Damn bro bro that was a productive class for sure. I did nothing.
  - Now I gotta put all me stuff back in me bag eh and then do somethin.
  - "Idk. *shrugs* Niagara Falls, Niagara Falls\u2026"
  fourthLines:
  - OOOHHH SPOT DODGE SPOT DODGE SPOT DODGEEEEEE.
  - "HAHAHHA I THINK I AM SO FUNNY AHHAHAHAHAH. Niagara Falls, Niagara Falls\u2026"
  fifthLines:
  - Everyone left but I guess I still be gamin eh?
  - "Niagara falls, Niagara falls\u2026"
  sixthLines:
  - "Zzzzzz. Maple Syrup. ZZZZzzzzz. Yee old Canada. Zzzzz. I miss my meese. Zzzzzzz
    Niagara falls, Niagara falls\u2026."
  idleImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8350c549764c21347acce454c9adb149, type: 3}
  talkingImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 05f89077cb387fa4c843918c7214af79, type: 3}
  firstInteraction: 1
  charPositions:
