MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1480296263}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 84246a412e120284ebb2f40012066458, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  charName: Christine
  firstLines:
  - Anyway that's why the Malcolm X Bot is the best character to main in Overwatch.
  - Oh right. I'm teaching. Good Morning.
  - We are starting class once everyone is ready.
  - Spoiler alert. They never will be.
  secondLines:
  - Hey guys. This is the lesson for the day and shit.
  - "Learn it I guess. Don\u2019t use Chat GPT or I\u2019ll end you."
  - Anyway Imma be over here playing Overwatch if you need help just gimme a holler.
  thirdLines:
  - "I\u2019m going into a meeting now. *sigh* I wish I could play overwatch."
  fourthLines:
  - "SHHHHH I\u2019M LOCKED IN TO OVERWATCH OMG I\u2019M WINNING!!!!! "
  - YAAZZZZZZZZZ.
  fifthLines:
  - "And in conclusion, that\u2019s why Palworld is the worst absolute dog shit poo
    poo character in Overwatch."
  - They were gassing that shit up like HighGuard I think Palworld should be eliminated,
    although it eliminated itself. It has nothing going for it. WHO IS PLAYING PALWORD
    IN 2026? NO ONE. ZERO PEOPLE. ZILCH.
  - ANYONE who gassed up Palworld should be humilaited just like Geoff Keighly was
    for hyping up High Guard.
  - Ummm. yeah I ran outta gas. My one keyboard line ain't working no more. I reached
    my character limit.
  - Follow me for more hot takes on X the everything app.
  - "Anyway though, It\u2019s hour 6 of Overwatch and I am still fully enjoying myself."
  sixthLines:
  - "Zzzzzz\u2026I miss my doogies\u2026 "
  - "ZZzzz Student loans. Omg how am I gonna pay my student loans\u2026"
  - ZZZZzzzzzzZZZZzzzz *snore*
  idleImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f0327d56db711e84c84a944c1769dbb1, type: 3}
  talkingImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e9662f04b3153e449ad0c1890d60daef, type: 3}
  firstInteraction: 1
  charPositions:
  - {fileID: 1576331993}
  - {fileID: 467234291}
  - {fileID: 1525080591}
  - {fileID: 1713078390}
  - {fileID: 551035813}
  - {fileID: 1320700194}
  charPositionIndex: 0
