      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Welcome to the DT Floor, a place of much whimsy and also much chudding.


    Those
    who inhabit this floor and the cafe (which you can go to with the elevator upstairs)
    embrace their chudness to the max, occasionally going to class, before spending
    the rest of the day doing whatever.


    Your Goal, our welcome guest, is to
    experience the chuddom at its peak, discover the environment, interact with the
    chuds, and make it through a full day.


    Can you do it? Well I guess we are
    going to find out...'
